  "description": "The new Voopoo PnP-X 2ml pod tank fuses the simplicity of a pod with the performance of a premium sub-ohm tank. The pod tank features an improved ‘infinite’ airflow system that enhances vapour production and flavour for a super-satisfying DL (direct to lung) experience. The tank is top-filling for easy, mess-free refills. The tank is compatible with all of Voopoo’s PnP coils for a near-limitless range of resistances to experiment with. The included 0.2 ohm and 0.3 ohm mesh coils offer a mesh build for immaculate flavour and are best used with high-VG , sub-ohm e-liquids, although you can achieve a fantastic MTL (mouth-to-lung) sensation by purchasing higher resistance Voopoo PnP coils. The PnP-X pod tank’s sturdy build is a blend of plastic and metal to create a tank that’s lightweight yet durable. And while the tank is ideal for use with Voopoo’s celebrated Drag X line of vape kits, the 510 connection allows you to pair the tank with any compatible device. Features 2ml e-liquid capacity 510 drip tip Infinite Airflow ring Leak-resistant Top Filling Ideal for MTL/DTL Vaping Compatible with Voopoo PnP coils",
